{"hero":"<div style=\"font-family:'Klarna Display',Inter,'Pretendard',-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--card-fg);height:100%;padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n    <strong style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.045em;\">Klarna.</strong>\n    <span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--card-fg);color:var(--card-bg);display:grid;place-items:center;\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 8h12l-1 11H7L6 8Z M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;\">Pay in 4 · 무이자</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:25px;font-weight:900;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:5px 0 12px;\">원하는 건 지금.<br>결제는 나답게.</div>\n  <div style=\"background:var(--card-surface);color:var(--card-fg);border:1px solid var(--card-border);border-radius:20px;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);flex:1;min-height:0;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;\">\n      <div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:13px;background:var(--card-accent);color:#0A0A0A;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;\">\n        <svg width=\"39\" height=\"29\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 44\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 27c7 0 13-3 18-10l6 8c7 5 14 7 23 8 3 1 4 3 3 6H10c-5 0-7-3-2-12Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M24 21l8 6m-3-10 8 8M10 36h46\" stroke=\"var(--card-accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"min-width:0;flex:1;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:var(--card-fg-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.0